  "description": "Please register interest by email enquiries only.\n\nMorrison Estates are delighted to present this superb four-bedroom, three-bathroom semi-detached home to the rental market at 15 College Park Way, Ballinteer, Dublin 16. Available from the beginning of October, the property is offered on a short-term basis only for a period of 3–6 months and can be provided furnished or unfurnished.\n\nExtending to approximately 122 sq.m., this exceptionally well-maintained home offers bright, spacious and versatile accommodation throughout. Occupying a quiet cul-de-sac position overlooking a large south-facing green, the property also benefits from a beautifully maintained and private rear garden.\n\nThe accommodation comprises a welcoming entrance hallway with guest W.C., a generous front living room with feature fireplace and bay window, a separate dining room, and a fully fitted kitchen. To the rear, a bright conservatory overlooks the garden and provides an excellent additional living space.\n\nUpstairs are four well-proportioned bedrooms, including a principal bedroom with en-suite, together with a recently refurbished main bathroom. The property has been carefully maintained and further benefits from upgraded double-glazed windows and a recently replaced gas-fired central heating boiler.\n\nExternally, the house enjoys a particularly attractive private rear garden which is not directly overlooked, together with a side passage and garden shed. To the front, a private driveway provides off-street parking for two cars, while the property's position overlooking the green creates an excellent sense of space and openness.\n\nCollege Park is a highly regarded and established Ballinteer development, ideally positioned close to Marlay Park, Dundrum Town Centre and Ballinteer Shopping Centre, together with an extensive range of local shops, cafés, recreational amenities and transport links. The M50 and LUAS Green Line are both within easy reach, providing convenient access throughout Dublin.\n\nThis is an excellent opportunity to rent a spacious and beautifully maintained home in a highly sought-after South Dublin location, with the additional flexibility of being offered furnished or unfurnished.\n\nPlease note: This property is available from the beginning of October on a short-term basis only, for a lease term of approximately 3–6 months.",
